ds_list_add(textList, "This card describes a powerful MALLET used commonly by trainers in Unova.", "As it says, it drains special energy from someone else's Pokémon.", "Ordinarily we'd say that using a weapon during a Pokémon battle violates the Official Pokémon League rules,", "But I think any reasonable trainer would accept losing to this glorious Mallet. I sure would.", "I mean come on, look at that thing!")